<title>UK: Export Development Corp sets 13 billion yen bond.</title>
<headline>Export Development Corp sets 13 billion yen bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following dual-currency bond was announced by lead manager LTCB International Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EXPORT DEVELOPMENT CORP</p>
<p> AMT    13.0 BLN YEN  COUPON     *5.45     MATURITY    16.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE   DUAL-CURRENCY ISS PRICE  98.50     PAY DATE    16.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.20	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES	*PAYABLE IN YEN, REDEMPTION IN AUSTRALIAN DOLLARS</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANNTAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 500     SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    PROVINCE OF ONTARIO AND THE LAWS OF CANADA</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
